## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Exact Exaltolide softness, Hedione HC texture, Haitian-vetiver grade, Vertofix Coeur, and literal Ambroxide remain gaps. Do not buy another clean musk or ozonic material for this test. Verify EB before mixing; all tinctures remain excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-02 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge La Nuit identity, cardamom authority, lavender-to-cedar continuity, transparency, thin/generic failure, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

